  "paragraph": 1,
  "text": "Modern AI models are remarkably capable, yet most of the time they sit trapped inside a plain chat window. Whenever you want real help, you end up playing the human copy-paste bridge: grabbing text from Slack, pasting notes from Notion, uploading files from your laptop, and manually typing the final results back into your calendar or project tracker.",
